1
00:00:00,014 --> 00:00:01,934
(Howard:)His name is Buttons.

2
00:00:02,475 --> 00:00:04,555
(Howard:)Anyway, if you had
your own game character...

3
00:00:04,727 --> 00:00:07,647
(Howard:)...we could hang out,
maybe go on a quest.

4
00:00:07,813 --> 00:00:11,103
- That sounds interesting.
- So you'll think about it?

5
00:00:11,275 --> 00:00:13,985
(Penny:)Oh, I don't think
I'll be able to stop thinking about it.

6
00:00:15,988 --> 00:00:17,698
(Raj:)Smooth.

7
00:00:19,659 --> 00:00:22,539
- We're home.
- Oh, my God. What happened?

8
00:00:22,703 --> 00:00:28,333
(Leonard:)Well, your ex-boyfriend sends his regards
and I think the rest is fairly self-explanatory.

9
00:00:28,501 --> 00:00:29,671
(Penny:)I'm so sorry.

10
00:00:29,835 --> 00:00:33,295
(Penny:)I really thought if you guys went
instead of me he wouldn't be such an ass.

11
00:00:33,464 --> 00:00:35,044
(Leonard:)No, it was a valid hypothesis.

12
00:00:35,216 --> 00:00:38,466
That was a valid hypo...?
What is happening to you?

13
00:00:39,011 --> 00:00:42,101
(Penny:)Really, thank you so much
for going and trying.

14
00:00:42,265 --> 00:00:45,805
You just... You're so terrific.

15
00:00:47,478 --> 00:00:51,188
(Penny:)Why don't you put some clothes on,
I'll get my purse, and dinner is on me, okay?

16
00:00:51,357 --> 00:00:52,527
- Really? Great.
- Thank you.

17
00:00:52,692 --> 00:00:59,022
(Leonard:)Okay.

